#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the documentation for the &kde; &systemsettings; module that "
"configures the <application>Nepomuk</application> &kappname; service."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je dokumentacija za &kde; &systemsettings; modul koji konfigurira "
"<application>Nepomuk</application> &kappname; uslugu."

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "Sistemske postavke"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nepomuk"
msgstr "Nepomuk"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "Meta podaci"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kappname; finds additional metadata on the Internet <emphasis>(via "
"Python plugins)</emphasis> and adds them to Nepomuk. It can retrieve data "
"for any document/movie/TV show or music file."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; pronalazi dodatne meta podatke na internetu <emphasis>(putem "
"Python dodataka)</emphasis> i dodaje ih Nepomuk-u. Može povratiti podatke za "
"bilo koji dokument / film / TV show ili muzičke datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "&dolphin; Integration"
msgstr "&dolphin; Integracija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a manual extraction you can start the &kappname; from &dolphin; via "
"the context menu. To do this right-click a file or a folder and select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Action</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Desktop Search</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Da bi počeli ručno vađenje možete pokrenuti &kappname; iz &dupin; putem "
"kontekstnog izbornika. Da bi ovo uradili kliknite desnim klikom na datoteku "
"ili folder i označite <menuchoice><guimenu>Radnja</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Pretraživanje na radnoj površini</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you have 4 different options to fetch the metadata:"
msgstr "Ovdje imate 4 različite opcije kako bi dohvatili metapodatke:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Normal</guilabel>: This will show the extraction dialog but skip "
"any file that already has some metadata attached to it."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Normal</guilabel>: To će pokazati dijalog vađenja, ali preskočiti "
"bilo koju datoteku koja već ima neke metapodatke u prilogu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Automatically</guilabel>: This will run the extraction job in the "
"background but skip any file that already has some metadata attached to it."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Automatski</guilabel>: To će pokrenuti posao ekstrakcije u "
"pozadini, ali preskočiti bilo koju datoteku koja već ima neke metapodatke u "
"prilogu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Force Download</guilabel>: Will show the extraction dialog and "
"also include files that already have metadata attached to it. This allows "
"you to manually specify new search parameter and thus correct wrong metadata."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prisili preuzimanje</guilabel>: Će prikazati dijalog ekstrakcije, "
"uključujući datoteke koje već imaju neke metapodatke u prilogu. To vam "
"omogućuje da ručno odredite novi parametar pretrage i na taj način ispravite "
"pogrešne metapodatake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Automatically, Force Download</guilabel>: This will run the "
"extraction job in the background and also replace already any data from a "
"previous extraction job."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Automatski forsiraj preuzimanje</guilabel>:  To će pokrenuti posao "
"ekstrakcije u pozadini i zamijeniti bilo kakve podatke iz prethodnog "
"ekstrakcijskog posla."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extractor Dialog"
msgstr "Izvlačenje dijaloga"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of &kappname;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Slika pozadine od &kappname;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of &kappname;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika pozadine od &kappname;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog allows to adjust the search parameter for each file. For each "
"file the automatically extracted metadata can be seen in <command>1</"
"command>. Depending on the file type different search options are available. "
"For a movie it is the title, for a TV show it is the name, season and "
"episode, for publications it is the author and title."
msgstr ""
"Dijalog omogućuje prilagođavanje parametara pretraživanja za svaku datoteku. "
"Za svaku datoteku automatski izvađen meta podatak može se vidjeti u "
"<command>1</command>. Ovisno o tipu datoteke, različite opcije pretraživanja "
"su omogućene. Za film to je prevod, za TV šou to je ime, sezona i epizoda, "
"za objavljena djela to je autor i naslov."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beside the search parameter it is possible to switch the used plugin for the "
"lookup. By default the preferred plugin is selected."
msgstr ""
"Pored parametra za pretraživanje moguće je promijeniti se korišteni dodat za "
"pretragu. Po defoltu je izabran preferirani dodatak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additional settings are available via the configure buttons as seen in "
"<command>2</command>."
msgstr ""
"Dodatna podešavanja su dostupna putem konfiguracijskih tipki kao što se vidi "
"u <command>2</command>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once everything is setup correctly the lookup can be started via the "
"<guibutton>Search</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Kada je sve pravilno postavljeno pretraživač može biti pokrenut sa "
"<guibutton>Pretraga</guibutton> tipkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All search results will be listed in the list view <command>3</command>. "
"Select the right entry you want fetch here."
msgstr ""
"Svi rezultati pretrage će biti navedeni u pregledu liste <command>3</"
"command>. Odaberite zapis koji želite dohvatiti ovdje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some more details about the currently selected entry is shown in tab "
"<command>4</command>. The show online link will open the web browser with "
"the website that will be used for the data extraction. To start the "
"extraction click on the <guibutton>Fetch Metadata</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Više detalja o trenutno odabranom unosu su prikazani na kartici <command>4</"
"command>. Pokazana online veza će otvoriti web preglednik sa web stranice "
"koja će se koristiti za ekstrakciju podataka. Za pokretanje ekstrakcije "
"pritisnite <guibutton>Donijeti meta podatak</guibutton> tipku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The results of the item extraction is shown in the tab <command>5</command>. "
"To save the metadata press the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Rezultati vađenja su prikazani na kartici <command>5</command>. Da sačuvate "
"metapodatke pritisnite <guibutton>Snimi</guibutton> tipku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a different file in the list of files the <guibutton>Previous</"
"guibutton> and <guibutton>Next</guibutton> buttons in <command>6</command> "
"can be used."
msgstr ""
"Da bi oznmačili različite datoteke u listi datoteka <guibutton>Prethodna</"
"guibutton> i <guibutton>Sljedeća</guibutton> tipke u <command>6</command> se "
"mogu koristiti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Service"
msgstr "Usluga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The background service is responsible for the metadata extraction for each "
"new file on the disk."
msgstr ""
"Pozadinska usluga je odgovorna za vađenje metapodataka za svaku novu "
"datoteku na disku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As soon as the <application>Nepomuk fileindexer</application> detects a new "
"file the extractor is started and tries to fetch additional data from the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"Čim <application>Nepomuk fileindexer</application> otkrije nove datoteke "
"vađenje je pokrenuto i pokušava dohvatiti dodatne podatke s interneta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will cause a lot of traffic especially when Nepomuk starts its initial "
"indexing."
msgstr ""
"To će prouzrokovati puno prometa pogotovo kada Nepomuk započne svoje početno "
"indeksiranje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fetcher"
msgstr "Dobavljač sadržaja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "The fetcher settings handle the general behavior of the &kappname;."
msgstr "Postavke dobavljača sadržaja rukuju sa opštim ponasanjem &kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opšte Postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Download Banner/Poster/Cover</guilabel>: If enabled the extractor "
"looks for the matching poster/banner or cover of the item to fetch. The "
"image will be saved into the application folder and added to the resource "
"via <application>Nepomuk</application>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Preuzmi zastavu/poster/naslovnu</guilabel>: Ako je omogućeno, "
"vađenje traži da donese odgovarajući poster/zastavu ili naslovnu stavke. "
"Slika će biti sačuvana u mapi aplikacije i dodata u resurse preko "
"<application>Nepomuk</application>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Download Publication References</guilabel>: This option allows the "
"publication search to download all cited references of the current "
"publication resource."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Preuzmi objavljivanje reference</guilabel>: Ova opcija omogućuje "
"objavljenom pretraživanju da preuzeme sve navedene reference trenutnih "
"objavljivanih resursa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As most publications tend to have many cited resources, this will take a lot "
"of time. If the information about the cited resources are not needed or just "
"for a few resources, it is better to disable this option. The cited "
"references can be retrieved later on for a single resource if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Većina publikacija imaju tendenciju da imaju mnogo navedenih resursa, pa će "
"ovo potrajati puno vremena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Save Image in Resource Folder</guilabel>: Instead of saving the "
"image into the application folder the image is saved next to the file."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Spremite sliku u resursima mapa</guilabel>: Umjesto da sačuva "
"sliku u mapu aplikacija, slika je sačuvana pored datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Might lead to duplicated images if the same image for two different "
"resources will be saved in different folders. This can happen for TV shows "
"and the season posters, when the episodes are in two different folders."
msgstr ""
"Može dovesti do duplih slika, ako se ista slika za dva različita izvora "
"spremi u različitim mapama. To se može dogoditi za TV emisije i postere "
"sezona, kada su epizode u dvije različite mape."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugin Selection"
msgstr "Izbor priključka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Preferred Plugin</guilabel>: Defines which plugin will be used "
"first to fetch the metadata from. Only if the first search failed the other "
"plugins are queried to get the information."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Preferirani dodatak</guilabel>: Definira koji će dodatak prvi "
"dohvatiti metapodatke. Samo ako je prva prvo pretraživanje neuspjelo, drugi "
"dodaci će se zatražiti kako bi dobili informacije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background Service"
msgstr "Pozadinski servisi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The service settings allow to <command>enable/disable</command> the "
"background service. If the service is enabled the extractor will be run on "
"each newly indexed file created by the <application>Nepomuk "
"fileindexerservice</application>. When the service is disabled the metadata "
"will only be fetched if the user requests it via the &dolphin; context menu."
msgstr ""
"Postavke usluge omogućuju <command>omogućite/onemogućite</command> "
"pozadinske uslugee. Ako je omogućena usluga vađenje će se pokrenuti na "
"svakoj novoj indeksiranoj datotci stvoren od <application>Nepomuk "
"fileindexerservice</application>. Kada je onemogućena uslugu metapodaci će "
"biti učitani samo ako korisnik zatraži preko &dolphin; kontekst izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Fetch document information</guilabel>: When this option is enabled "
"the Service will automatically fetch additional information about any "
"document that got indexed by Nepomuk."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zatraži informaciju o dokumentu</guilabel>: Kada je ova opcija "
"uključena služba će automatski preuzeti dodatne informacije o bilo kojem "
"dokumentu koji je indeksiran od Nepomuk-a."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This could expose private data to the used plugin search engine. The search "
"will use data from the filename, any given metadata attached to the file and "
"some possible title string from the first page of any pdf file."
msgstr ""
"To bi moglo izložiti privatne podatke preko korištenih dodataka "
"pretraživača. Pretraživač će koristiti podatke iz datoteke, svakom "
"metapodataku priključenom na datoteku i neke od mogućih niza naslova od prve "
"stranice bilo koje pdf datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not sure you want this, leave this option disabled and call the "
"metadata extractor manually on any document that should be used."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste sigurni da ovo želite, ostavite ovu opciju onemogućenu i ručno "
"pozovite vađenje metapodataka u bilo kojem dokumentu koji je korišten."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Fetch music information</guilabel>: When this option is enabled "
"the Service will automatically fetch additional information about any music "
"file that got indexed by Nepomuk. If disabled you need to start the "
"extractor manually for any music file."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Daj informaciju o muzici</guilabel>:Kada je ova opcija omogućena "
"servis će automatski dati dodatne informacije o muzičkoj datoteci koja je "
"indeksirana od Nepomuk-a. Ako je onemogućena morate pokrenuti ručno vađenje "
"za bilo koju muzičku datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Fetch video information</guilabel>: When this option is enabled "
"the Service will automatically fetch additional information about any video "
"file that got indexed by Nepomuk. If disabled you need to start the "
"extractor manually for any video file."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Daj informaciju o videu</guilabel>: Kada je ova opcija omogućena "
"servis će automatski dati dodatne informacije o video datoteci koja je "
"indeksirana od Nepomuk-a.  Ako je onemogućena morate pokrenuti ručno vađenje "
"za bilo koju video datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use Folder Whitelist</guilabel>: When this option is enabled only "
"the folders specified by the whitelist are used for the metadata lookups. "
"The list of the folders can be configured using <guibutton>Customize "
"Folders</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristi mapu popisa dopuštenih</guilabel>:Kada je ova opcija "
"omogućena samo mape koje su određene popisom dopuštenih korištene su za "
"upite metapodataka. Lista ovih foldera je konfigurisana korištenjem "
"<guibutton>Prilagođene mape</guibutton> tipke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Dodaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this tab all available plugins are shown. For more information about the "
"plugin press the <guibutton>Info</guibutton> button. Some plugins allow to "
"specify additional settings which can be seen via the <guibutton>Configure</"
"guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj kartici svi dodaci su prikazani. Za više informacija o dodacima "
"pritisni  <guibutton>Info</guibutton> tipku. Neki dodaci omogućuju da "
"odredite dodatne postavke koje se mogu vidjeti kroz <guibutton>Configure</"
"guibutton> tipku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename Parsing"
msgstr "Rasčlanjenje naziva datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using this tab you can fine tune filename parsing during automatic metadata "
"extraction. Use the examples to construct your own effective parsing regular "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći ovu karticu možete fino podešavati datoteke raščlanjivanjem tokom "
"automatskog vađenja metapodataka. Koristite primjere da stvorite vlastito "
"gramatičko rasčlanjivanje regularnih izraza."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits and License"
msgstr "Zasluge i Licence"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "CREDIT_FOR_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ZASLUGE_ZA_PREVOĐENJE"

#. Tag: chapter
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "&underFDL; &underGPL;"
msgstr "&underFDL; &underGPL;"
